@startuml QuickBite - Create and Pay Order Sequence

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant Frontend as "Frontend\n(Next.js)"
participant Keycloak as "Keycloak"
participant OrderService as "Order Service\n:8080"
participant RestaurantService as "Restaurant Service\n:8081"
participant PaymentService as "Payment Service\n:8084"
participant NotificationService as "Notification Service\n:8085"
participant Kafka as "Kafka"
database OrderDB as "PostgreSQL\n(Orders)"
database PaymentDB as "PostgreSQL\n(Payments)"
database NotificationDB as "PostgreSQL\n(Notifications)"

== Аутентификация ==
User -> Frontend: Открыть приложение
Frontend -> Keycloak: Запрос токена
Keycloak --> Frontend: JWT токен
Frontend -> Frontend: Сохранить токен

== Просмотр меню и добавление в корзину ==
User -> Frontend: Открыть список ресторанов
Frontend -> RestaurantService: GET /api/restaurants
RestaurantService --> Frontend: Список ресторанов

User -> Frontend: Выбрать ресторан
Frontend -> RestaurantService: GET /api/menu-items/restaurant/{id}
RestaurantService --> Frontend: Список блюд

User -> Frontend: Добавить блюда в корзину
Frontend -> Frontend: Сохранить в localStorage

== Создание заказа ==
User -> Frontend: Оформить заказ
Frontend -> OrderService: POST /api/orders\n+ JWT токен\n+ items[]
activate OrderService

OrderService -> RestaurantService: GET /api/restaurants/{id}
RestaurantService --> OrderService: Restaurant данные

OrderService -> RestaurantService: GET /api/menu-items/prices?ids=...
RestaurantService --> OrderService: Map<menuItemId, price>

OrderService -> OrderService: Вычислить totalPrice\n(price * quantity)

OrderService -> OrderDB: INSERT Order\nstatus=CREATED
OrderDB --> OrderService: Order saved

OrderService -> Kafka: Publish "order-created" event
Kafka --> NotificationService: Consume event
activate NotificationService
NotificationService -> NotificationDB: INSERT Notification\n"Заказ создан"
NotificationDB --> NotificationService: Saved
deactivate NotificationService

OrderService --> Frontend: Order response\n(id, totalPrice, status=CREATED)
deactivate OrderService

Frontend --> User: Отобразить заказ

== Оплата заказа ==
User -> Frontend: Нажать "Оплатить"
Frontend -> PaymentService: POST /api/payments\n+ orderId\n+ paymentMethod
activate PaymentService

PaymentService -> OrderService: GET /api/orders/{orderId}
OrderService --> PaymentService: Order (totalPrice)

PaymentService -> PaymentService: Создать Payment\namount=totalPrice\nstatus=PROCESSING

PaymentService -> PaymentDB: INSERT Payment
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Payment saved

PaymentService -> PaymentService: Simulate payment\ngateway (1 sec)

PaymentService -> PaymentDB: UPDATE Payment\nstatus=COMPLETED
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Updated

PaymentService -> Kafka: Publish "payment-completed" event\n{orderId, paymentStatus}
deactivate PaymentService

PaymentService --> Frontend: Payment response\n(COMPLETED)

Kafka --> OrderService: Consume "payment-completed"
activate OrderService
OrderService -> OrderDB: UPDATE Order\nstatus=CONFIRMED
OrderDB --> OrderService: Updated

OrderService -> Kafka: Publish "order-status-changed"
deactivate OrderService

Kafka --> NotificationService: Consume event
activate NotificationService
NotificationService -> NotificationDB: INSERT Notification\n"Заказ подтвержден"
NotificationDB --> NotificationService: Saved
deactivate NotificationService

== Автообновление на фронте ==
loop Каждые 5 секунд
  Frontend -> OrderService: GET /api/orders/{id}
  OrderService --> Frontend: Order (status=CONFIRMED)
  Frontend --> User: Обновить статус
end

@enduml
